  {
   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Payment Methods Row\n\nA line (\"Bayar pakai apa saja\") and a row of generic payment chips (Transfer bank, Kode QR, E-wallet, COD, Kartu) that pop in one after another, each with a small drawn glyph. No brand names or logos. The line and the methods are variables.\n\nCategory: commerce. Length: 4.5 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- Telling customers which ways of paying a shop accepts.\n- A closing moment of an online shop promo (\"bayar pakai apa saja\").\n\nAvoid when:\n- Showing one payment being made: use qr-pay-scan.\n- A checkout flow: use checkout-flow.\n\nVariables:\n- heading (string): Heading, default \"Bayar pakai apa saja\"\n- methods (string): Methods, default \"Transfer bank; Kode QR; E-wallet; COD; Kartu\"\n- stagger (number, 0.06-0.4): Gap between chips, default 0.14\n- chip_color (color): Chip colour, default \"#ffffff\"\n- bg_color (color): Background, default \"#ffffff\"\n- text_color (color): Text colour, default \"#0a0a0a\"\n- muted_color (color): Muted colour, default \"#737373\"\n- main_color (color): Accent, default \"#2563eb\"\n- font_family (string): Font, default \"Geist\"\n- transparent (boolean): Transparent, default false\n\nSource: Mosio original. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
  {
   "path": "scene.html",
